// Settings > Visibility: what the person sees, the users and groups who see
// every file, with the check box that adds or removes Everyone, and Add…
// and Remove beside the list, as on the Keyboard page, and what the list
// means below it.
IDD_SETTINGS_VISIBILITY DIALOGEX 0, 0, 309, 294
STYLE DS_SHELLFONT | DS_CONTROL | WS_CHILD
FONT 9, "Segoe UI", 400, 0, 0x1
